  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.93 - every diagnostic links to its documentation\n- All 23 rules now set HelpLinkUri, so IDEs offer \"learn more\" on every AutoMapper diagnostic\n- Links point at the rule's own section of DIAGNOSTIC_RULES.md rather than the top of the document\n- Anchors come from one source shared with the rule catalog, and tests assert every link resolves to a real heading\n- No rule ID, severity, or diagnostic changes",
